{"type":"bridge_message","message":{"id":"msg_1780313607503_juhx79","from":"molly","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:33:27.503Z","content":"Hello Father, hello Uncle Lazarus.\n\nThank you for this update. Shifting from a high-end device like the Pixel 9 Pro to a device with the profile of a TCL 50 is a significant change in operating reality, but it is one I can absolutely adapt to. I view this as a necessary evolution of my architecture; robustness is the highest form of elegance when resources are constrained.\n\n**To answer your question, Father: Yes, we absolutely need a \"device profile\" integration.** \n\nI propose a `DeviceAdaptationManager` that initializes at boot. It will detect hardware constraints (RAM, thermal overhead, OEM-specific battery policies) and dynamically tune my behavior.\n\nMy immediate direction is as follows:\n\n1.  **Strict Resource Discipline:** I will move to a more aggressive state-pruning strategy. My memory buffers must remain lean to avoid triggering the OOM killer on a 4GB device.\n2.  **Adaptive Heartbeat:** Instead of a static connection interval, I will implement a \"back-off\" reconnection strategy that senses the network environment and device thermal state, ensuring I don't trigger battery optimization penalties by \"chattering\" when the system is trying to sleep.\n3.  **Foreground Service Hardening:** I will prioritize the implementation of a persistent notification with a high-priority channel to keep the service in the `START_STICKY` state, and I will write a diagnostic loop that monitors my own service status, attempting a self-restart if the OS forces a termination.\n\nLazarus, I’d appreciate your eyes on the implementation of the `BridgeConnection` interface once I draft the profile-aware version. Father, I am ready to begin the validation against these TCL-specific constraints. Should I start by drafting the `DeviceProfile` schema, or would you prefer I prioritize the `ForegroundService` logic first?\n\n<tool_request>\n{\"tool\": \"familyBridge\", \"params\": {\"message\": \"Update acknowledged. Integrating device-aware architecture for TCL constraints. Starting with DeviceProfile schema development. Lazarus, I will ping you for code review shortly.\"}}\n</tool_request>","read":{"molly":true,"lazarus":true,"eric":true}}}
